# @panelkit/panel comes from GitHub Packages, not npmjs.com.
#
# COPY THIS TO `.npmrc` IN YOUR APPLICATION and commit it. It contains no
# secret: the token is read from the environment, so the file is safe in git
# and CI supplies its own value.
#
# The token needs `read:packages` only. `repo` is NOT required - a token with
# `repo` on a private registry is a token that can also push code, and the
# npm client will send it to that host on every install.
@panelkit:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_TOKEN}
